					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13442255#post-4715469</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13442255/scp-600-ko#post-4715469</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Fri, 10 Jul 2020 18:33:39 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>T Rutherford</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>4620432</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>It's an upvote for me, but only barely. The interesting formatting pushes it to neutral, and the bare shade of a story puts it .001 over into approval. I'd have liked to see more exploration into the &quot;splitting branches&quot; concept, with ideas growing into other ideas, separated by possible containment procedures or theories on this scips existence.</p> <p>It's barebones, but serviceable, with an original format screw. +1</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
