						 <p>I'm sorry to hear that you can't read this article well on mobile. But the image and texts were precisely arrayed based on the PC, because I'm not skilled at adjusting the syntax for the mobile environment, and they will be a total mess if I change the width of the background image for mobile devices.</p> <p>Using some other web browser applications may help. On my phone, with google chrome browser, I can read this article moving from side to side. I have no better way for fix it. Sorry.</p> 
				 	]]>
